# ZL Limiter for WebCLAP

ZLLimiter by ZL Audio (zsliu98), a lookahead limiter with true peak detection and oversampling, ported to WebCLAP.
This is not an official ZL Audio release.

- ZLLimiter: https://github.com/ZL-Audio/ZLLimiter (commit cb52b21, before its first release)
- This port, and the complete source of this bundle: @SOURCE_URL@
  Build it with `scripts/build-zl-limiter.sh`, which fetches every dependency below at the commit named here.

Changes in this port (`patches/zl-limiter-webclap.patch`): the processor builds without its editor. The plugin
has no window: openDAW's device panel (`ui/panel.html`) is all of it, with the output's measurements computed in the
page from the audio the plugin sends.

